{
  "$comment": [
    "The design system is authored in telecraft-dev/telecraft and copied here.",
    "ADR-0047's consequences call this dependency 'a versioned release, not a",
    "copy'. It is now exactly that: telecraft tags releases under ADR-0049, and",
    "`ref` names one. A tag cannot move, so these copies cannot go stale",
    "underneath anyone, and taking a newer design system is a deliberate act",
    "with a version number on it.",
    "",
    "`ref` is what the copies were taken from and `commit` is what that ref",
    "resolved to. Both are recorded because a reader checking whether a file is",
    "current wants the immutable one, and a person choosing what to upgrade to",
    "wants the readable one.",
    "",
    "While `ref` names a release tag, `tools/vendor.mjs check` reports what has",
    "changed on main since, rather than failing on it: that difference is the",
    "next release being written, not drift. Point `ref` at main and the copies",
    "are expected to track main again, and drift is fatal."
  ],
